name = "Mishima Shōsō"
blurb = "Mishima Shōsō was a painter and ukiyo-e artist from Edo, a member of the [url=art_school:Shijō School]Shijō school[/url].

He started his career with historical scenes and [url=art_style:kachō-e]kachō-e[/url], but is better known for his later book illustrations."
